<template><section class="memory-evidence" aria-label="研究记忆来源"><h3>研究记忆来源</h3><p>{{ memory.scope }}</p><p v-if="memory.refresh_required">日期已变化，请重新载入记录时效。</p><template v-else><p>来源分级分数：{{ memory.quality_score??'未评估' }} · 记录时效分数：{{ memory.freshness_score??'未评估' }}</p><p>共 {{ memory.event_count }} 条匹配记录，{{ memory.scored_event_count }} 条纳入评分。</p></template><p>{{ memory.notice }}</p><section v-if="memory.earnings_window&&!memory.refresh_required" class="estimated-window"><h4>预计财报窗口 · 未经公司公告确认</h4><p>{{ memory.earnings_window.next_report_label }} · {{ memory.earnings_window.estimated_next_earnings_date }} · 距评估日 {{ memory.earnings_window.days_to_earnings }} 天</p><p>{{ memory.earnings_window.notice }}</p><p>最近财季 {{ memory.earnings_window.latest_report_period }} · {{ memory.earnings_window.source_evidence.source }}</p><details><summary>预计窗口的来源版本</summary><p>{{ memory.earnings_window.source_evidence.id }} · v{{ memory.earnings_window.source_evidence.revision }}</p><p>来源获取于 {{ memory.earnings_window.source_evidence.retrieved_at }}</p></details></section><ul><li v-for="gap in memory.coverage_gaps" :key="gap">{{ gap }}</li></ul><article v-for="event in memory.timeline" :key="event.event_key"><strong>{{ event.title }}</strong><p>{{ types[event.event_type]||event.event_type }} · {{ event.occurred_at }} · {{ memory.refresh_required?'时效待刷新':freshness[event.freshness]||event.freshness }}</p><p v-if="event.action?.reason">处理说明：{{ event.action.reason }}</p><p v-if="event.action?.snooze_until">延后至 {{ event.action.snooze_until }}</p><details><summary>来源与版本</summary><p>{{ event.source_collection }} · {{ event.source_id }} · v{{ event.source_revision }}</p><p>内容指纹 {{ event.source_digest }}</p><template v-if="event.linked_source"><p>关联来源：{{ event.linked_source.title }} · {{ event.linked_source.id }} · v{{ event.linked_source.revision }}</p><p>关联内容指纹 {{ event.linked_source.digest }}</p></template></details></article><p v-if="!memory.timeline.length">尚无匹配的来源事件。</p></section></template>
